<p dir="auto">100% free CC0 game dev assets derived from <a href="https://thebasemesh.com/" rel="nofollow">https://thebasemesh.com</a> and converted into glTF binary as an asset pallet. Every model is made to real-world scale and comes with basic UVs. You can drag and drop from the github pages into platforms that support drag n' drop real-time editing (<a href="https://hyperfy.io/" rel="nofollow">https://hyperfy.io</a>, <a href="https://github.com/webaverse-studios">webaverse</a>, <a href="https://github.com/jbaicoianu/janusweb">janusweb</a>, etc).</p>
